{'symbol': 'RHI', 'date': '2022-02-02 11:26:00', 'title': 'ROBERT HALF NAMED TO FORTUNE\'S "MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES" LIST FOR 25TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'MENLO PARK, CALIF., FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GLOBAL TALENT SOLUTIONS AND BUSINESS CONSULTING FIRM ROBERT HALF (NYSE: RHI) HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE FORTUNE "WORLD\'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES®" LIST AND IS THE ONLY STAFFING FIRM INCLUDED FOR 2022.'}